  "bodyHash": "9b36c23dfd954492",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>Create: Connected</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/947914_all.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/Vg5TIO6d?style=flat&label=Modrinth\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-connected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/947914?style=flat&label=CurseForge\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fcreate-connected-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/create-connected-mod/localized.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/3AvrppcgG3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/891929048895356948/widget.png?style=shield\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>一款 Create 的模组扩展，添加了各种你希望在游戏中存在的便利性方块。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flysine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/cd02548b-be01-4a01-b707-ffcb913f5299.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/3AvrppcgG3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/891929048895356948/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Create: 扩展中心服务器\"></a></p>\n<p>这是该模组的 Forge/NeoForge 版本。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/click_here_for_fabric_version-informational?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"静态徽章\"></a></p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>需要为 Create 机器提供稳定、沉浸式的区块加载功能吗？请查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-power-loader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Power Loader</a></strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>1.3 版本更新内容</h2>\n<p><strong>已停止支持 Minecraft 1.20.1</strong></p>\n<p>Minecraft 1.20.1 将不会获得 1.3 版本的更新。1.3.0 版本中的关键错误修复将被移植到仅适用于 Minecraft 1.20.1 的 1.2.3 版本中。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/02d33d98-ac20-4629-8993-149fe1123d24\" alt=\"kinetic_battery\"> <strong>重构的动能电池</strong></p>\n<p>动能电池现在以物品形态保存电荷，并且仅在维持网络运行时释放必要的应力单位。欢迎查看新的沉思场景了解更多详情！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/60382812-0859-4a47-bbd1-88a9ececed30\" alt=\"inventory_bridge\"> <strong>改进的物品桥</strong></p>\n<p>现在通过物品桥提取物品时会尊重其上的过滤器设置。你也可以利用此功能控制库存链接网络中可见的物品。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/hlysine/create_connected/assets/25472513/871b1ee6-33c6-4102-80ed-3670641a8d33\" alt=\"empty_fan_catalyst\"> <strong>更多的催化剂</strong></p>\n<p>Create: Dragons Plus 的染色催化剂现已支持 Dye Depot 的颜色。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/hlysine/create_connected/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">……以及更多更改与修复</a></p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<h3>新增方块与物品</h3>\n<p>为你的 Create 机器配备离合器和齿轮箱，为红石电路添加二极管和发射器，以及用于优化物流的可旋转保险箱和储罐！一套完整的方案满足你所有的 Create 技术需求。访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/hlysine/create_connected/wiki/New-Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Wiki</a> 查看完整列表。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/hlysine/create_connected/wiki/New-Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Vg5TIO6d/images/897c4d67eae94a366c49782ddb1654c5a6e383c5.png\" alt=\"所有功能\"></a></p>\n<h3>功能开关</h3>\n<p>不喜欢某些功能？你可以在配置文件中将其禁用。觉得水平储罐过于强力？同样可以在配置中削弱它。本模组高度可定制，以适应你整合包的需求。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/hlysine/create_connected/wiki/Configs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Vg5TIO6d/images/d74a9a1a353caee83b0d5dc69c60305a14699d3a.png\" alt=\"功能开关系统\"></a></p>\n<h3>Create 功能增强</h3>\n<p>增强了顺序变速齿轮和属性过滤器，支持在装置上使用功能性方块，蓝图支持存放在子文件夹中等……为 Create 的功能带来小而精的便利性改进。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/hlysine/create_connected/wiki/Create-Enhancements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/hlysine/create_connected/assets/25472513/31d7c32e-0cc1-4238-a220-315d8269810f\" alt=\"火车上的原版方块\"></a></p>\n<h2>下载</h2>\n<p>前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Modrinth</strong></a> 或 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-connected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>CurseForge</strong></a> 下载本模组。</p>\n<p><strong>支持的 Create 版本：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Create</th>\n<th>Create: Connected</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5.1e</td>\n<td>0.0.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5.1f - 0.5.1j</td>\n<td>0.0.3 - 0.9.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6.0.0 - 6.0.5</td>\n<td>1.0.0 - 1.1.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6.0.6</td>\n<td>Unsupported, please update</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6.0.7+</td>\n<td>1.1.9 - latest</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>兼容性</h2>\n<p><strong>与 Create: Extended Cogwheels 不兼容</strong>：功能不受影响，但由于 Extended Cogwheels 会将 Connected 组件视为齿轮，会导致令人困惑的画面显示异常。</p>\n<h2>使用条款</h2>\n<p>请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/hlysine/create_connected/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">许可协议</a>。具体附加条款详见许可协议文件末尾。</p>\n<p>本模组开放接受建议，如果你对其进行了修改，请提交 Issue 或 PR，以便我考虑将你的用例加入模组中。</p>\n<h2>贡献指南</h2>\n<p>如果你对参与开发感兴趣，请查阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/hlysine/create_connected/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">贡献指南</a>。</p>\n<h2>支持作者</h2>\n<p>支持我工作的最佳方式就是在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上下载本模组。一键即可享受更流畅的下载体验，同时支持开源软件。</p>\n<p>如果你想提供更直接的支持，可以点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fO4O2TL8YV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<p><strong>翻译</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>感谢 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fcreate-connected-mod%252freports%252ftop-members\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin 贡献者</a> 在本地化方面付出的努力</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>灵感来源</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create 模组的 Discord 服务器与 Reddit 社区</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>素材</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Casa Bossa Nova Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)<br>遵循 Creative Commons: BY 3.0 许可协议<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby%252f3.0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/</a></li>\n<li>Local Forecast - Elevator Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)<br>遵循 Creative Commons: BY 3.0 许可协议<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby%252f3.0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/</a></li>\n</ul>",
